  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.8.4:\n      - Adds generated mapper and projection metadata through AstraFlow.Generators.\n      - Adds public generated mapper metadata provider contracts for mapping rules and projection metadata.\n      - Keeps runtime mapper/projection scanning as the fallback path while adding deterministic generator tests, docs, and release verification.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
